# Never upload these to the edge.
#
# The asset directory is the repo root (the bundle IS the repo), so without this
# file `wrangler deploy` would publish the tooling, the capture notes and the
# screenshots to umbrassi.com. Read by Workers Static Assets from the assets
# directory at deploy time.

tools/
docs/
.github/
CAPTURE.md
README.md
wrangler.toml
.assetsignore
.gitignore
